  "verification_limits": [
    "Constructed private observations on the pinned local instance; no live DNS, passive DNS, web crawl, external provider, peer synchronization or detection publication was used.",
    "The favicon integer is an explicitly synthetic selector. DOM fingerprints were computed from local harmless HTML tag sequences; they do not describe a real target.",
    "The demonstrated matches are exact local typed-value matches. Broader fuzzy, group-based and external pivoting methods are discussed without claiming that every algorithm is implemented automatically by MISP.",
    "The optional private workspace was created through the UI. Value nodes were added through their UI control; additional real fixture event/attribute references were added through the application client API. The native Pivot Explorer screenshots use a separate ephemeral canvas populated only through its UI controls.",
    "Normal-user UI occurrence counts were checked alongside authenticated attribute API selections. The fixture does not validate recipient visibility after remote sharing or the independence of real-world sources."
  ]
}
